    "readmeSummary": "## Instagram Reel Scraper\n\nInstagram Reel Scraper scrapes Instagram Reels pages to extract rich, reel-level data beyond what the Instagram API returns, producing structured metadata and media details for short-form videos. It captures engagement metrics (likes, shares, comments, views, play counts, timestamps), content metadata (captions, transcripts, hashtags, mentions, tagged users, pinned status, paid partnership and sponsor/co-author info, location), media assets (downloadable video URLs, original video and audio URLs, images/thumbnails, media dimensions, video duration), and recent comment activity (latest comments with replies, likes and timestamps). The Actor supports bulk processing of profiles or reel URLs, date-range filtering and pre-filtering options (including skipping pinned reels), and can include or exclude trial reels; outputs are oriented toward analytics, trend analysis and content-level inspection.\n\n## Use cases\n\n- Influencer research and influencer collaboration analysis  \n- Campaign tracking and paid partnership auditing  \n- Competition monitoring and short-form video performance benchmarking  \n- Content auditing, media archiving and downloading reel assets  \n- Popular reels discovery and hashtag-based reels research  \n- Tracking reel metrics over time for performance monitoring  \n- Identifying trends, mentions and tagged collaborators from hashtags/mentions/tagged users"
